  "prefLabel": "Plc 1001.10 Fee for Wall Display Certificate - Original or Replacement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.10 Fee for Wall Display Certificate - Original or Replacement.\n\n(a) A licensee may obtain a professionally-printed wall display certificate by submitting a written request in accordance with Plc 304.14 and paying the actual cost of having a vendor produce the certificate or $20, whichever is less.\n\n(b) The fee for obtaining a professionally-printed replacement wall display certificate shall be the actual cost of having a vendor produce the certificate or $20, whichever is less.\n\nSource. #13264, INTERIM, eff 9-22-21; ss by #13336, eff 1-27-22; ss by #13336, eff 1-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
